            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematical+structure"} mathematical structure
            in intensional type theory, rather than being something in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/foundations+of+mathematics"} foundations of mathematics
            to merely address
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/size+issues"} size issues
            or do mathematics in.
