                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{ax}_\mathrm{Id}:\sum_{\mathrm{Id}:\prod_{A:U} (T(A) \times T(A)) \to U} \prod_{A:U} \prod_{x:T(A)} \prod_{y:T(A)} T(\mathrm{Id}(A, x, y)) \simeq (x =_{T(A)} y)
          %p
            Regularity and closure under identity types implies that the universe is closed under
