            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/FinSet"} FinSet
            are all regular univalent Tarski universes. The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/types+of+propositions"} types of propositions
            in a type theory are univalent Tarski universes: they model a dependent type theoretic model of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/propositional+logic"} propositional logic
